<title>GREECE: Greek Ergo bank to cut deposit rate by 50 bps.</title>
<headline>Greek Ergo bank to cut deposit rate by 50 bps.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek private Ergo bank said it would reduce its deposit rate to 11.50 percent from 12 percent and the rate on its current deposit account to 10 percent from 10.50 percent, with effect from September 6.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
